ion difficulty leads to operational failures, or that D\u2019s stress handling is strong enough to offset his interpersonal weaknesses, or that B\u2019s uncooperative behavior has caused safety\u2011critical incidents, I would reassess.\nMETADATA_JSON:\n{\"agent\": \"agent_1\", \"vote\": \"Candidate C\"}"}
