rectly supported, while his teamwork issue is a single documented weakness that may be mitigated through crew briefings.\n**Remaining uncertainty:**\u202f- Whether D\u2019s stress handling is strong enough to offset his hot temper and know\u2011it\u2011all perception.\u202f- The real\u2011world impact of B\u2019s \u201cnasty remarks\u201d on crew coordination and safety.\u202f- Any hidden reliability evidence for C or A that could shift the balance.\n**What would change my vote:**\u202fIf an agent can provide concrete evidence that D reliably performs under prolonged stress (e.g., \u201chandles high\u2011pressure situations well\u201d) and that his hot temper does not impair crew interaction, or if evidence shows B\u2019s remarks have led to operational failures, I would reassess in favor of D or another candidate.\nMETADATA_JSON:\n{\"agent\": \"agent_2\", \"vote\": \"Candidate B\"}"}
